I added a combined demo hub page: combined-demo/demo_hub.html which embeds the three project demos (password-generator, mac-address-generator, mall-inventory) into a single interactive page.

Open the file in your browser to preview: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prajapati-kamal/titanic-survival-prediction/main/combined-demo/demo_hub.html

Recording tip: open the page and record an ~8-12s clip using Loom/QuickTime/OBS, then upload the MP4/GIF to Upwork as the portfolio media.
